Origin
------

This repository is a modified version of earlier work. It contains a Python translation of
the EWARS-csd disease-forecasting model, made by this repository's contributors in 2026.
The line of descent is:

1. **EWARS-csd**, the WHO early warning and response tool for climate-sensitive diseases,
   in the R implementation distributed in an earlier version of
   https://github.com/Laith-hk/AUTO-EWARS-csd, under the GNU General Public License
   version 3.
2. **chapkit_ewars_model**, https://github.com/chap-models/chapkit_ewars_model, a modified
   version of the WHO EWARS model by the CHAP team, wrapped as a chapkit service for
   chap-core, under the GNU General Public License version 3. This repository translates
   it at commit 964eea8bfdb194ca8985723216e94f1ac63aa4f1.
3. **This repository**: the R model translated to Python, with its distributed-lag
   cross-basis computed by dlnmpy and its INLA fit re-implemented in Python; the analysis
   comparing the translation with the R original; and the record of how it was made.

As a work based on the GPL-3.0 sources above, this repository as a whole is licensed under
the GNU General Public License, version 3 or any later version.


